\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo; 阅读并同意《服务协议》和《隐私协议》 &rdquo; </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，点击</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;登录&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">即可。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">7</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-si