g></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">操作步骤</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">验证码登录</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请参见</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff; font-size: 10.5pt;\">如何登录会员中心</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">忘记密码</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">①进入会员中心登录页，点击 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;忘记密码&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②请根据您的账号类型选择</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;电子邮箱&rdquo;</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;手机号码&rdquo;</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进行接下来的操作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">③输入您的账号（电子邮箱</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">手机号码），点击</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;获取验证码&rdquo; </span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">并输入验证码。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">④输入新密码并再次确认密码。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">4</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">⑤勾选 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;阅读并同意 《服务协议》 和 《隐私协议》 &rdquo; </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，点击</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;确认并登录&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">即可直接登录会员中心。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">5</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n</body>\n</html>','','',0,0,3,1,1673341163,0,0,0);
