nsi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中修改密码，具体操作请见下文：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">操作步骤</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">①登录会员中心后，点击 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;账户信息&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（您可以通过下图中的两种方式查看账户信息）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②查看账户详情</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">③在下方 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;账户信息&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">栏中，点击</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;密码&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">右侧的</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo; 。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">④在弹窗页面输入原始密码后，再输入新密码即可。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">4</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">⑤如果您忘记了原始密码，请点击 &ldquo;验证码修改&rdquo; </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">5</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">⑥使用注册账号（电子邮件</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">手机号码）获取验证码，重新设置密码。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">6</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</body>\n</html>','','',0,0,2,1,1673341264,1673344922,0,0);
