'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②如下图所示，弹窗页面点击</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;获取验证码&rdquo; </span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，并输入验证码以完成身份验证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">5</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">③输入新的邮箱地址，并点击</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;获取验证码&rdquo; </span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">进行验证即可成功修改。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">6</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; line-height: 130%; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</body>\n</html>','','',0,0,3,1,1673341555,0,0,0);
insert  into `idcsmart_addon_idcsmart_help`(`id`,`addon_idcsmart_help_type_id`,`title`,`content`,`keywords`,`attachment`,`hidden`,`index_hidden`,`read`,`admin_id`,`create_time`,`update_time`,`cron_release`,`cron_release_time`) values (9,3,'如何进行实名认证','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">实名认证是为了进一步核实您的注册信息，避免身份被盗用等潜在的不安全因素，为了保护您的账户安全与合法权益，请您在使用我们的服务前先进行</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实名认证</span> </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&middot;个人认证</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&middot;企业认证</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">操作步骤</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">①点击 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff; font-size: 10.5pt;\">账户信息</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进入账户信息页面</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②点击</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;未认证&rdquo;</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提示，进入实名认证界面，根据您的账户使用主体与实际情况，选择</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个人认证</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">企业认证</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">②您也可以点击左上角</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">LOGO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进入个人中心，在基础信息栏右侧直接选择 </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;个人认证&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;企业认证&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.85pt; line-height: 130%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&middot;个人认证</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如果您的账号归属于您个人所有，请选择 </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个人认证</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，选择</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;认证方式&rdquo;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">后，点击</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;下一步&rdquo; </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">4</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如下图，在跳转页面根据字段提示填写实名信息，完成后点击 &ldquo;下一步&rdquo; 。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">5</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ⅲ</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在跳转页面确认信息无误后，根据页面提示进行实名认证。如下图，需使用支付宝扫码认证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">6</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&middot;企业认证</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ⅰ</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">. &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如果您的账户属于企业所有，请选择</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;企业认证&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并点击</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;下一步&rdquo; 。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">7</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ⅱ</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">. </span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">在跳转页面根据字段提示填写企业信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">8</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ⅲ</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">确认企业信息无误后，点击 </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;下一步&rdquo; </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，并在跳转页面根据提示完成企业认证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">9</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</body>\n</html>','','',0,0,2,1,1673341695,0,0,0);
insert  into `idcsmart_addon_idcsmart_help`(`id`,`addon_idcsmart_help_type_id`,`title`,`content`,`keywords`,`attachment`,`hidden`,`index_hidden`,`read`,`admin_id`,`create_time`,`update_time`,`cron_release`,`cron_release_time`) values (10,3,'如何添加子账户','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如果您需要更多人来共同管理与维护线上业务，可通过设置</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">子账户</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">精细分配操作权限与产品权限。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">操作步骤</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">①点击 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff; font-size: 10.5pt;\">子账户管理</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，进入子账户列表。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②点击左上角 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;新增子账户&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">③在跳转页面根据字段提示填写子账户信息，并配置管理权限，点击 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;保存&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">即可。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</body>\n</html>','','',0,1,1,1,1673341759,0,0,0);
