New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">①登入 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;会员中心&rdquo; </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，点击</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;发票管理&rdquo;</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，选择</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;发票设置&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②在 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;发票抬头&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一栏，点击右侧</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;添加&rdquo; </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">可添加发票抬头信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">③根据弹窗字段提示填写抬头信息即可。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&middot;公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如果购买主体为政企单位，抬头类型请选择</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;公司&rdquo;，并根据字段提示填写公司开票信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">3</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&middot;个人</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如果您是以个人名义购买，抬头类型请选择</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;个人&rdquo; 。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">4</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</body>\n</html>','','',0,1,2,1,1673342768,0,0,0);
insert  into `idcsmart_addon_idcsmart_help`(`id`,`addon_idcsmart_help_type_id`,`title`,`content`,`keywords`,`attachment`,`hidden`,`index_hidden`,`read`,`admin_id`,`create_time`,`update_time`,`cron_release`,`cron_release_time`) values (22,5,'如何设置发票收件地址','<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">当您申请开具纸质发票或电子发票时，您需要提前设置收件地址与电子邮箱。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">操作步骤</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">①登入</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;会员中心&rdquo;</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，点击</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;发票管理&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，选择</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;发票设置&rdquo; 。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">1</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">②点击 </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;收件地址&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">右上角</span> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;添加&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">添加收货地址。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">图</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">2</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 130%;\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">③在弹窗页面根据字段提示填入地址。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8500pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagina